%% @width 288
%% @kicker Where documentation debt gets paid
%% @alt Missing documentation never breaks the build, but it taxes three places: every pull request where a reviewer has to ask what a function does, every onboarding where a new hire reverse-engineers the deploy process, and every incident where the one person who understands the failing job is asleep.
%% @glyph debt | doc cross
%% @glyph pr | doc question
%% @glyph onboard | reader question
%% @glyph incident | rack corner=cross
%% @spacing 16,36
flowchart LR
  debt["Missing docs"]:::focal
  pr["Pull request"]
  onboard["Onboarding"]
  incident["Incident"]
  debt --> pr
  debt --> onboard
  debt --> incident
